stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (EXECUTIVE CLOUD STRATEGY MEMORANDUM - PAGE 1. Over the past decade enterprise computing paradigms have transitioned from on-premise hardware to distributed cloud infrastructure. Our organization maintains 14 distinct datacenter environments across North America and Europe. Maintaining physical servers requires significant facilities cooling, power redundancy, and hardware replacement cycles. Industry benchmarks indicate modern cloud environments enhance deployment agility and developer satisfaction.) Tj ET
endstream
