stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 720 Td (EXECUTIVE CLOUD STRATEGY MEMORANDUM - PAGE 2. The executive steering committee formally voted to shut down all on-premise datacenters by June 30, 2027. Chief Financial Officer Walter White authorized a capital budget expenditure of $4.2 million for AWS migration services. Director of Infrastructure Brenda Scott will lead the transition team and report progress bi-weekly. All department leaders must submit application dependency matrices by December 15, 2026.) Tj ET
endstream
